    impl Tr for i64 {
    {"code": "E0311", "severity": "error", "message": "`impl Tr for i64` overlaps `impl Tr for i64`", "file": "err/rejected_impls.bmb", "line": 33, "col": 17, "end_line": 33, "end_col": 20, "fix": {"message": "a trait has one impl for a type: remove one of them, or make their types differ"}}

    impl Shape for Wrap<Sq> {}
    {"code": "E0311", "severity": "error", "message": "`impl Shape for Wrap<Sq>` overlaps `impl Shape for Wrap<T>`", "file": "err/traits.bmb", "line": 53, "col": 20, "end_line": 53, "end_col": 28, "fix": {"message": "a trait has one impl for a type: remove one of them, or make their types differ"}}

Everything else the program prints must stay as it is.

